<!doctype lake><title>❄️ 𝓐𝓽𝓽𝓮𝓷𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="XcIFA" id="XcIFA" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0569c757" id="u0569c757">🌸</span><span data-lake-id="u86d2238d" id="u86d2238d"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐕𝟑.𝟐: 𝐏𝐮𝐬𝐡𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐅𝐫𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐞𝐫 𝐨𝐟 𝐎𝐩𝐞𝐧 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uf7595d99" id="uf7595d99"><strong><span data-lake-id="u88f0c355" id="u88f0c355">闭源模型与开源模型之间的性能差距似乎并未收敛，反而呈现扩大趋势。作者识别出限制开源模型复杂任务能力的三个关键不足</span></strong></p><ul list="ub447133b"><li fid="u21feb550" data-lake-id="u21e6c7b7" id="u21e6c7b7"><span data-lake-id="ua8ed0602" id="ua8ed0602">在架构层面，模型普遍依赖标准注意力机制，这严重制约长序列处理的效率。这种低效性对规模化部署和有效的后训练均构成重大障碍</span></li><li fid="u21feb550" data-lake-id="u08521d3b" id="u08521d3b"><span data-lake-id="ud8dfbce5" id="ud8dfbce5">在资源分配方面，开源模型在后训练阶段的计算投入不足，限制其在高难度任务上的表现</span></li><li fid="u21feb550" data-lake-id="u6f783efe" id="u6f783efe"><span data-lake-id="u29229310" id="u29229310">在 AI 智能体场景中，开源模型的泛化能力和指令遵循能力明显落后于闭源专有模型，从而制约其在实际部署中的有效性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u59297557" id="u59297557"><strong><span data-lake-id="udcd759ae" id="udcd759ae" style="color: #DF2A3F">首先引入 DSA，这是一种旨在显著降低计算复杂度的高效注意力机制。该架构有效缓解效率瓶颈，即使在长上下文场景中也能保持模型性能；</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u24ecc3e9" id="u24ecc3e9">提出一套稳定且可扩展的强化学习训练方案，使后训练阶段的计算投入能够大幅扩展</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5a286880" id="u5a286880">；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0175e145" id="u0175e145" style="color: #5C0036">培养模型在工具使用场景中可泛化的推理能力，采用 DeepSeek-V3 的方法开展冷启动，将推理与工具使用统一到同一条轨迹中。随后，开展大规模智能体任务合成，生成超过 1,800 个不同的环境以及 85,000 条复杂提示。这些大规模合成数据用于驱动强化学习过程，显著增强模型在智能体场景中的泛化能力和指令遵循能力</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="whzgi" id="whzgi" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1d6ac4ef" id="u1d6ac4ef">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u94d2cb2d" id="u94d2cb2d"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩𝐒𝐞𝐞𝐤-𝐕𝟑.𝟐 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uddf99a28" id="uddf99a28"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc2473482" id="uc2473482" style="color: #000000">DeepSeek-V3.2 采用与 DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp 完全相同的架构。相较于 DeepSeek-V3.1 的最终版本 DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus，DeepSeek-V3.2 在架构上的唯一改动，是通过持续训练引入 DeepSeek 稀疏注意力</span></strong></p><ul list="u1eeafa92"><li fid="u2a8134ab" data-lake-id="u5337558d" id="u5337558d"><span data-lake-id="u57f8378c" id="u57f8378c" style="color: #000000">DSA 的原型主要由两个组件构成：lightning indexer 和细粒度 token 选择机制</span></li><li fid="u2a8134ab" data-lake-id="u974ed49b" id="u974ed49b"><span data-lake-id="ua66fbc25" id="ua66fbc25" style="color: #000000">lightning indexer 计算查询 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3df0574f8df24a87181f1e5a8f72d6ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezs7q%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u60c76715" id="u60c76715" style="color: #000000">与其前序 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_s%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1d18ebc4fd9517411b835409f0b3e52f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gV3yb%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d3a4f50" id="u0d3a4f50" style="color: #000000">之间的索引分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22I_%7Bt%2Cs%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda8e4ab827f34c2e811ae9b2485679b8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wvLAT%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u92121c36" id="u92121c36" style="color: #000000">，以确定查询 token 应选择哪些 token</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u14c4a7e5" id="u14c4a7e5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22I_%7Bt%2Cs%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7BH%5E%7BI%7D%7Dw_%7Bt%2Cj%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Ctext%7BReLU%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cj%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F229e88c315f6efe7481f353ce1789e0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oXkja%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="u1de87f33"><li fid="u26eb1dc8" data-lake-id="u58058fe0" id="u58058fe0"><span data-lake-id="u86827c4b" id="u86827c4b" style="color: #000000">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22H%5E%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c9d9add5d1d2d58e5fef7aa83d03a62.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qOSX6%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u1f092c3b" id="u1f092c3b" style="color: #000000">表示索引器的头数；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_%7Bt%2Cj%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%5E%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F719521e91ae942d7bad55ca5dc95f121.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jStll%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ucd92bbde" id="ucd92bbde" style="color: #000000">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bt%2Cj%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F241f16eb5b238d4f960fe9df8147157b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vm69W%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ubec0b7bd" id="ubec0b7bd" style="color: #000000">均由查询 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7da655072cb606d866aed0b8354535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aens5%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="udae9b7a9" id="udae9b7a9" style="color: #000000">生成，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bs%7D%5E%7BI%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%5E%7BI%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38545d32c8c906cc3439dafca66ff8a9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sfhzj%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="udd1b33d8" id="udd1b33d8" style="color: #000000">则由前序 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fba5076ba9b732b9cd5bacb865db11f51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yLFEB%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7036207" id="ub7036207" style="color: #000000">生成。出于吞吐量方面的考虑，选择 ReLU 作为激活函数。由于索引器的头数较少，且可以采用 FP8 实现，因此具有很高的计算效率</span></li><li fid="u26eb1dc8" data-lake-id="u3432c0e8" id="u3432c0e8"><span data-lake-id="u94422a9a" id="u94422a9a" style="color: #000000">给定每个查询 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7da655072cb606d866aed0b8354535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b3skP%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3152c3b" id="ua3152c3b" style="color: #000000">对应的索引分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7BI_%7Bt%2Cs%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F62b64f67a5d8a557659326d2487f512a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22acyIc%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7cc477f" id="ua7cc477f" style="color: #000000">，细粒度 token 选择机制仅检索索引分数最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22buGEA%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uf40a2034" id="uf40a2034" style="color: #000000">个键值条目</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_s%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6ad293ba1de5fa3ef9ca2ddaf226cd6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d8QDG%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8013fbf" id="uf8013fbf" style="color: #000000">。随后，在查询 token </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcd7da655072cb606d866aed0b8354535.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axAlg%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u77bb5543" id="u77bb5543" style="color: #000000">与稀疏选取的键值条目</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_s%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa6ad293ba1de5fa3ef9ca2ddaf226cd6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EWa87%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cb0d357" id="u0cb0d357" style="color: #000000">之间应用注意力机制，计算注意力输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7e4aed712f34784d39d10eca50b423ef.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XSycW%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf0854bf" id="ucf0854bf" style="color: #000000">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ee1bf4d" id="u0ee1bf4d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D_t%3D%5C%5Ctext%7BAttn%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bc%7D_s%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%7C%5C%5C%2CI_%7Bt%2Cs%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Ctext%7BTop-k%7D%5C%5Cleft(I_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd08ffbdff9ee6d6a9f234afee19b3200.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rr9uV%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udd1ea4aa" id="udd1ea4aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua539ee3d" id="ua539ee3d" style="color: #000000">考虑到模型需要从 DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus 继续训练，基于 MLA 为 DeepSeek-V3.2 实例化 DSA。在计算内核层面，为提高计算效率，每个键值条目必须在多个查询之间共享。因此，基于 MLA 的 MQA 模式实现 DSA，其中，每个潜在向量均由当前查询 token 的所有查询头共享</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5fa3c8bf" id="u5fa3c8bf" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790826320347-1e310afa-5dcc-4278-949c-ab00ee6a4135.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u89884f22-6324-407f-b2eb-2fdad5c5434%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u635bf9ed-cf53-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A636.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A334%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A117331%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A996%2C%22originHeight%22%3A522%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22INPUTHIDDENH%2COOOO...OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A207%2C%22y%22%3A474%2C%22width%22%3A435%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OIIOOOOOOOS%22%2C%22x%22%3A283%2C%22y%22%3A57%2C%22width%22%3A375%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22HIDDENUOOOO.OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A386%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGTIGTIOO.OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A20%2C%22y%22%3A193%2C%22width%22%3A257%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FCRKFLOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A249%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CVOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A514%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-QUERYATTENTION(COREATTENTION)%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A399%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FGLOK%22%2C%22x%22%3A705%2C%22y%22%3A351%2C%22width%22%3A143%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOP-KSELECTOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A493%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A154%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LIGHTNING%22%2C%22x%22%3A777%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARTIALLYPAR%22%2C%22x%22%3A713%2C%22y%22%3A394%2C%22width%22%3A124%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATEL%22%2C%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPLYROPEAPPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A702%2C%22y%22%3A416%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A115%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A97%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OGE%22%2C%22x%22%3A253%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KFO%22%2C%22x%22%3A362%2C%22y%22%3A366%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A358%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LIL%22%2C%22x%22%3A801%2C%22y%22%3A197%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDENUR%22%2C%22x%22%3A175%2C%22y%22%3A16%2C%22width%22%3A258%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LNDEXER%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%7B9I3%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A282%2C%22width%22%3A51%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f0f0f0%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22udbb7fad1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7ee81ce0" id="u7ee81ce0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u935f6bd4" id="u935f6bd4" style="color: #663000">将上下文长度扩展至 128K 的 DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus 基础模型检查点为起点，先进行持续预训练，再进行后训练，最终得到 DeepSeek-V3.2</span></strong></p><ul list="ub91d198a"><li fid="u14ec3362" data-lake-id="u6ffba809" id="u6ffba809"><span data-lake-id="u4590dbc6" id="u4590dbc6" style="color: #000000">稠密预热阶段：首先通过一个短暂的预热阶段初始化。保留稠密注意力，并冻结索引器之外的所有模型参数。为使索引器输出与主注意力分布对齐，对于第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HWT48%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7386676a" id="u7386676a" style="color: #000000">个查询 token，对所有注意力头的主注意力分数求和，得到聚合分数；沿序列维度进行 L1 归一化，得到目标分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4c34455491f7454dcfdc8eae33502069.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rmcB2%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u0d782234" id="u0d782234" style="color: #000000">。基于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8c767dab48bb1a7cfdb859e05ca7cd07.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pam3X%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u0a66254f" id="u0a66254f" style="color: #000000">，采用 KL 散度损失作为索引器的训练目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2d6b9a48" id="u2d6b9a48" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BI%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_t%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(p_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ctext%7BSoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(I_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3b8c1799a3d81fa6b8ae53fe8ec406d9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XkAje%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="uf0595109"><li fid="u2b3f6eec" data-lake-id="u5ae1d9db" id="u5ae1d9db"><span data-lake-id="u65796bae" id="u65796bae" style="color: #000000">稀疏训练阶段：索引器预热完成后，引入细粒度 token 选择机制，并优化所有模型参数，使模型适应 DSA 的稀疏模式。在此阶段，仍持续将索引器输出与主注意力分布对齐，但仅考虑选中的 token 集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Bs%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%7C%5C%5C%2CI_%7Bt%2Cs%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Ctext%7BTop-k%7D%5C%5Cleft(I_%7Bt%2C%3A%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F57085e8fc6daed92b77a4c373d47f567.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rPbIm%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u9caadfa5" id="u9caadfa5" style="color: #000000">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9890b44b" id="u9890b44b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BI%7D%3D%5C%5Csum_t%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(p_%7Bt%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Ctext%7BSoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(I_%7Bt%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd01fcfb4423e9ff3e1ae27940636a6f1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DbFLV%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card></p><ul list="u63d418bd"><li fid="uecfecdc7" data-lake-id="u7158b96a" id="u7158b96a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87eac216" id="u87eac216" style="color: #E4495B">将索引器的输入从计算图中分离，以实现独立优化。索引器的训练信号仅来自</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D%5E%7BI%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcc7bfaa9f9b4927ef6793d5b6c775ac2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bMlHc%22%7D" style="color: #E4495B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc47b2604" id="uc47b2604" style="color: #E4495B">，而主模型仅依据语言建模损失进行优化</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1d3dd13b" id="u1d3dd13b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790828034698-38366f0c-1fc1-49c1-96f8-96dbdddba715.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u8e5e9469-1644-452d-8449-cb61e6ca693%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u2a5c2978-1f41-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A845%2C%22height%22%3A335%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A213548%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1515%2C%22originHeight%22%3A600%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-QUERYATTENTION(COREATTENTION)%22%2C%22x%22%3A936%2C%22y%22%3A132%2C%22width%22%3A423%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDENUOOOO....OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A84%2C%22y%22%3A30%2C%22width%22%3A451%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOOWIOOTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A971%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A379%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A444%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A299%2C%22height%22%3A52%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MULTI-HEADATTENTION(COREATTENTION)%22%2C%22x%22%3A193%2C%22y%22%3A147%2C%22width%22%3A397%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AMHAMODEOFMLA.%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A557%2C%22width%22%3A328%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22THIDDENHOOOO....OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A132%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A395%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CVKOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1120%2C%22y%22%3A248%2C%22width%22%3A254%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PUTHIDDENHTOOOO..%22%2C%22x%22%3A868%2C%22y%22%3A501%2C%22width%22%3A300%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FLTIH%E5%B0%8FOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A779%2C%22y%22%3A205%2C%22width%22%3A278%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BMOAMODEOFMLA.%22%2C%22x%22%3A974%2C%22y%22%3A556%2C%22width%22%3A327%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOG%22%2C%22x%22%3A327%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A206%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CYOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A524%2C%22y%22%3A421%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A842%2C%22y%22%3A434%2C%22width%22%3A185%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OI(OO%22%2C%22x%22%3A252%2C%22y%22%3A80%2C%22width%22%3A192%2C%22height%22%3A42%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22YOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1293%2C%22y%22%3A380%2C%22width%22%3A194%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A815%2C%22y%22%3A369%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A41%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LGITOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A220%2C%22width%22%3A199%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WYKCWVCP%22%2C%22x%22%3A477%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A243%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A62%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1143%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A139%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A1051%2C%22y%22%3A320%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22AOOTO%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A322%2C%22width%22%3A235%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A358%2C%22y%22%3A269%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OUTPUTHIDDEN%22%2C%22x%22%3A827%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONCATENATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1184%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%AD%E5%90%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A745%2C%22y%22%3A295%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A958%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22KO%22%2C%22x%22%3A332%2C%22y%22%3A325%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOAO%22%2C%22x%22%3A906%2C%22y%22%3A64%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A368%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ANPLYROPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A1108%2C%22y%22%3A430%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMOOC%22%2C%22x%22%3A97%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22EKO%22%2C%22x%22%3A1055%2C%22y%22%3A376%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PLYROP%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A401%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22T%22%2C%22x%22%3A222%2C%22y%22%3A47%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A40%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f1%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub89d1dcc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="gfLTf" id="gfLTf" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u72442081" id="u72442081">⚓</span><span data-lake-id="u7065ddf3" id="u7065ddf3"> 𝐏𝐨𝐬𝐭-𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u628733e4" id="u628733e4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u390c8595" id="u390c8595" style="color: #000000">完成持续预训练后，进一步进行后训练，得到最终的 DeepSeek-V3.2。DeepSeek-V3.2 的后训练同样采用稀疏注意力，其使用方式与稀疏持续预训练阶段一致。对于 DeepSeek-V3.2，沿用 DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp 的后训练流程，包括专家模型蒸馏和混合强化学习训练</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ufd701452" id="ufd701452"><strong><span data-lake-id="udf23f0cb" id="udf23f0cb">专家模型蒸馏：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ueced3fd8" id="ueced3fd8" style="color: #000000">针对每项任务，首先构建一个专用于相应领域的专家模型，所有专家模型均由同一个预训练 DeepSeek-V3.2 基础模型检查点微调得到</span></strong></p><ul list="u852adc1d"><li fid="u26b1ea52" data-lake-id="u63d3777f" id="u63d3777f"><span data-lake-id="u958a02b2" id="u958a02b2" style="color: #000000">除写作任务和通用问答外，的框架还涵盖六个专门领域：数学、编程、通用逻辑推理、通用智能体任务、智能体编程和智能体搜索，所有领域均支持思考与非思考两种模式。为每个专家模型投入大规模计算资源进行强化学习训练</span></li><li fid="u26b1ea52" data-lake-id="u87a12761" id="u87a12761"><span data-lake-id="udb9c225d" id="udb9c225d" style="color: #000000">采用不同的模型，分别生成用于长思维链推理和直接回答生成的训练数据。专家模型训练完成后，便用于为最终模型检查点生成特定领域的数据。实验结果表明，使用蒸馏数据训练的模型，其性能仅略低于相应领域的专家模型，而这一性能差距可通过后续的强化学习训练有效消除。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u454f761e" id="u454f761e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ce9dcca" id="u2ce9dcca">混合强化学习训练：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u0274cfe7" id="u0274cfe7" style="color: #000000">对于 DeepSeek-V3.2，仍采用组相对策略优化作为强化学习训练算法</span></strong></p><ul list="u179a4c2c"><li fid="u36743521" data-lake-id="u0f110429" id="u0f110429"><span data-lake-id="ube21a66f" id="ube21a66f" style="color: #000000">与 DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp 一致，将推理、智能体和人类对齐训练整合到同一个强化学习阶段。这种方式能够有效平衡不同领域的性能，同时避免多阶段训练范式中常见的灾难性遗忘问题</span></li><li fid="u36743521" data-lake-id="uf1c28489" id="uf1c28489"><span data-lake-id="u039daecf" id="u039daecf" style="color: #000000">对于推理和智能体任务，采用基于规则的结果奖励、长度惩罚和语言一致性奖励。对于通用任务，采用生成式奖励模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf251a477" id="uf251a477"><strong><span data-lake-id="u31e0f78e" id="u31e0f78e">DeepSeek-V3.2 与 DeepSeek-V3.2-Speciale：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u61fac02a" id="u61fac02a" style="color: #000000">DeepSeek-V3.2 整合从专家模型蒸馏得到的推理、智能体和人类对齐数据，并经过数千步持续强化学习训练，得到最终的模型检查点</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5ee5d152" id="u5ee5d152"><span data-lake-id="ucb38df62" id="ucb38df62" style="color: #000000">对于每个给定的问题</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j5f2b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61bbce7c" id="u61bbce7c" style="color: #000000">，从旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JgUYS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2dba6e38" id="u2dba6e38" style="color: #000000">中采样一组回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bo_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Co_G%5C%5C%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F09f57cc12367de76ba80782b57e1874a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EOqXT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76066a3a" id="u76066a3a" style="color: #000000">，GRPO 通过最大化以下目标来优化策略模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yo7cS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube8f2aa0" id="ube8f2aa0" style="color: #000000">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue8c2b464" id="ue8c2b464" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%5C%5Csim%20P(Q)%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%5Cn%5C%5CBigg%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5CBigg%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67850d816e6af2767aa4bff05c99f028.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fdrZs%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ubea1b248" id="ubea1b248" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa36fa86cf02a0ff69acf630903db6273.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iOOzL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7917d1b7" id="u7917d1b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5a1f2d33" id="u5a1f2d33">无偏 KL 估计：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d722901" id="u0d722901" style="color: #000000">由于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F490918764b16c5a0a4f87aedb2b38f8c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cncrD%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4f00224" id="ua4f00224" style="color: #000000">采样自旧策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffb8f15bcb1f99ced644d28674cdd84fc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IrBf6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a2ee0c9" id="u0a2ee0c9" style="color: #000000">，利用当前策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XuDp9%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uabbeb4fd" id="uabbeb4fd" style="color: #000000">与旧策略</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22D54V5%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u55a0040f" id="u55a0040f" style="color: #000000">之间的重要性采样比率，对 K3 估计器进行校正，以获得无偏的 KL 估计</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u78164fab" id="u78164fab" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D-%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D-1%5C%5Cright).%20%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F93004de17404a915851e967bcfc61fd3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IomMW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ud3761363"><li fid="ud1625dbf" data-lake-id="u8ef5f143" id="u8ef5f143"><span data-lake-id="u09f926ea" id="u09f926ea" style="color: #000000">这一调整直接使该 KL 估计器的梯度成为无偏估计，消除系统性估计误差，从而促进稳定收敛</span></li><li fid="ud1625dbf" data-lake-id="uc1d128a7" id="uc1d128a7"><span data-lake-id="u299af4b5" id="u299af4b5" style="color: #000000">这与原始 K3 估计器形成鲜明对比，尤其是在采样 token 在当前策略下的概率显著低于其在参考策略下的概率时，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cll%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0f5a975b62d01043dc2b31654a489fda.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a2sxH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3b0f1bd" id="ub3b0f1bd" style="color: #000000">。在这种情况下，K3 估计器的梯度会赋予这些 token 过大且无界的权重，以最大化其似然，从而产生噪声较大的梯度更新。这些更新不断累积，导致后续迭代的样本质量下降，并引发不稳定的训练动态</span></li><li fid="ud1625dbf" data-lake-id="ud069a184" id="ud069a184"><span data-lake-id="u3e293710" id="u3e293710" style="color: #000000">发现不同领域适用的 KL 正则化强度有所不同。对于数学等特定领域，采用相对较弱的 KL 惩罚，甚至完全不使用 KL 惩罚，可能获得更好的性能</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5e3549aa" id="u5e3549aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="uee069c9d" id="uee069c9d">离策略序列掩蔽：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u00d633f0" id="u00d633f0" style="color: #000000">为提高强化学习系统的效率，通常先生成一个大批次的 rollout 数据，再将其拆分为多个小批次，执行多步梯度更新</span></strong></p><ul list="u1ecd45e5"><li fid="u0ff0df40" data-lake-id="u37267141" id="u37267141"><span data-lake-id="u79d319eb" id="u79d319eb" style="color: #000000">这种做法本身就会引入离策略行为。此外，用于高效数据生成的推理框架通常经过高度优化，其实现细节可能与训练框架不同。这种训练与推理的不一致会进一步加剧离策略程度</span></li><li fid="u0ff0df40" data-lake-id="ud08f3e76" id="ud08f3e76"><span data-lake-id="u3ce9795d" id="u3ce9795d" style="color: #000000">为稳定训练并提高对离策略更新的容忍度，屏蔽那些引入显著策略偏离的负样本序列，其中，策略偏离程度通过数据采样策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WbAH6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d4401f3" id="u5d4401f3" style="color: #000000">与当前策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22E8Y35%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4c51416" id="uc4c51416" style="color: #000000">之间的 KL 散度来衡量。具体而言，在 GRPO 损失中引入二值掩码</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6f5dde593f0bc27956e14b5eaec2ed17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l2BFo%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub55a352c" id="ub55a352c" style="color: #000000">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf1b83119" id="uf1b83119" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%5C%5Csim%20P(Q)%2C%5C%5C%7Bo_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%5Cn%5C%5CBigg%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)M_%7Bi%2Ct%7D-%5C%5Cbeta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BD%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bref%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5CBigg%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8446aba79315e5af80f42f688ed49301.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UIZsH%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u82c53251" id="u82c53251" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22M_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn0%20%26%20%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3C0%2C%5C%5Cdfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Co_i%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cdfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(o_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2Co_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%3E%5C%5Cdelta%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B4pt%5D%5Cn1%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4fca06e5c1b100794ebc268fe50e332e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LNC1k%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u572fe3e6"><li fid="u4653f7df" data-lake-id="ua10deba6" id="ua10deba6"><span data-lake-id="u978ba5c9" id="u978ba5c9" style="color: #000000">此处的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22agMYr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4592deef" id="u4592deef" style="color: #000000">表示推理框架直接返回的采样概率，因此，旧策略与当前策略之间的 KL 散度同时涵盖上述两种离策略来源。仅屏蔽优势为负的序列</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uad92d643" id="uad92d643"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf86dcb1d" id="uf86dcb1d">保持路由：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b995c87" id="u5b995c87" style="color: #000000">混合专家模型通过在推理时仅激活部分专家模块来提高计算效率。然而，推理与训练框架之间的差异叠加策略更新的影响，即使对于完全相同的输入，也可能导致推理与训练阶段的专家路由不一致。这种不一致会使被激活的参数子空间发生突变，从而破坏优化稳定性并加剧离策略问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u63f8ac3f"><li fid="u7533472c" data-lake-id="u308b2ad2" id="u308b2ad2"><span data-lake-id="u3522490b" id="u3522490b" style="color: #000000">为缓解这一问题，保留推理框架在采样时使用的专家路由路径，并在训练阶段强制采用相同的路由路径，以确保优化的是相同的专家参数</span></li><li fid="u7533472c" data-lake-id="u9731a228" id="u9731a228"><span data-lake-id="ue1b45760" id="ue1b45760" style="color: #000000">保持路由对 MoE 模型强化学习训练的稳定性至关重要，并从 DeepSeek-V3-0324 开始将其纳入强化学习训练流程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4db1d0f4" id="u4db1d0f4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u80609041" id="u80609041">保持采样掩码：</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u70344cea" id="u70344cea" style="color: #000000">Top-p 和 top-k 是广泛使用的采样策略，用于提高大语言模型生成回答的质量。在强化学习训练中采用这些策略同样有益，因为这能避免极低概率的 token 被采样并用作优化目标</span></strong></p><ul list="u5bf86da0"><li fid="u93ecd975" data-lake-id="u2eab47aa" id="u2eab47aa"><span data-lake-id="uc7748029" id="uc7748029" style="color: #000000">尽管这种截断操作能够维持样本质量，但它也会导致</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YUnIw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua15c873d" id="ua15c873d" style="color: #000000">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VZC40%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16ad41df" id="u16ad41df" style="color: #000000">的动作空间不匹配，从而违背重要性采样的基本原则并破坏训练稳定性</span></li><li fid="u93ecd975" data-lake-id="u2030f250" id="u2030f250"><span data-lake-id="u79297679" id="u79297679" style="color: #000000">为解决这一问题，保留从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F031c97167daa03ad4ff7583a3b69f6d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DIQtU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73738a12" id="u73738a12" style="color: #000000">采样时使用的截断掩码，并在训练过程中将其应用于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LFNhz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8986617" id="uc8986617" style="color: #000000">，确保两种策略具有相同的动作子空间。实验表明，将 top-p 采样与保持采样掩码策略结合，能够有效维持强化学习训练过程中的语言一致性</span></li></ul>